{
  "note": "Ground-truth tenant / PW0 / no-effect matrix for the assembled management-readonly-local-v1 stack (task-sp-98, ADR-0024). It joins each owner's already-published fail-closed matrix (Omniscience service-contract.json fail_closed_matrix, Barbarossa read-only edge, Portal service-contract.json fail_closed_matrix) into the integrated AC-SP98-5 (synchronized-local-tenant-pw0-no-effect) expectations. A live capture folds observed outcomes onto these expectations; a forbidden favorable outcome is never a PASS.",
